{"full":"AnkanMisra/MicroAI-Paygate","name":"MicroAI-Paygate","description":"A high-performance, crypto-monetized AI microservice architecture implementing the x402 Protocol","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":99,"forks":61,"created":"2025-12-08T22:48:55Z","updated":"2026-10-01T16:07:17Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://microai-paygate.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://microai-paygate.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:48:22.507Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:48:22.507Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T05:48:22.507Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:10.266Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:03.254Z","stars":99,"forks":61},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:22.507Z","stars":99,"forks":61}],"technologies":[],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:43.218Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Payment authorization, replay protection, and signed receipts for AI APIs.","MicroAI Paygate is an open-source reference stack for payment-gated AI requests. It combines a Go API gateway, a Rust EIP-712 verifier, a Next.js wallet experience, configurable memory or Redis state, and a local TypeScript SDK.","An unsigned request receives HTTP 402 Payment Required. The client signs the returned payment context, retries with X-402- headers, and receives an AI result plus a gateway-signed receipt."],"features":["Explicit authorization — wallets sign EIP-712 payment contexts before the AI provider is called.","Replay protection — the verifier supports process-local memory or shared Redis nonce claims.","Signed receipts — the gateway signs request and response hashes and supports receipt lookup by ID.","Operational controls — timeouts, CORS, rate limits, optional response caching, health checks, and Prometheus metrics are built in.","Two client paths — use the browser wallet flow or the repo-local TypeScript SDK."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AnkanMisra/MicroAI-Paygate/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"62167264ba92fc34a223a909fab46ef13f2f6e968176bec082ce80e94188c6cb","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:15:20.366Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:51.095Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Payment authorization, replay protection, and signed receipts for AI APIs.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AnkanMisra/MicroAI-Paygate/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"62167264ba92fc34a223a909fab46ef13f2f6e968176bec082ce80e94188c6cb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AnkanMisra/MicroAI-Paygate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:51.096Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T16:07:17Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AnkanMisra/MicroAI-Paygate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:51.097Z","hash":"62167264ba92fc34a223a909fab46ef13f2f6e968176bec082ce80e94188c6cb","originalBytes":12690,"storedBytes":12690,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["gateway","verifier","bun","run","redis","sdk","receipt","web","payment","typescript","chain","test","api","key","openrouter","wallet","local","memory","signed","store","cache","nonce","default","public","readme.md","receipts","authorization","browser","development","install","participant","provider","replay","shared","url","app","base","bash","before","cargo","client","context","demo","e2e","eip-712","microai","nonces","openapi.yaml","optional","private","recipient","request","response","retry","rust","stack","challenge","contexts","enabled","env.example","headers","limits","ollama","paygate","project","provider.","required","secret","sepolia","server","signature","signing","signs","typecheck","unit","unsigned","used","x-402-","address","amount","audience","bench","both","build","calls","chains","checks","component","const","contributing.md","decoding","deploy.md","deployment","documentation","env","env.production.example","ethers","expected","facilitator","false","g--","guide","how